# This repo is public and GitHub Pages serves it from main, root. Anything
# ignored here is also anything that will never be published, so keep the list
# narrow and never add a pattern that could swallow a real document. In
# particular *.pdf and *.html are PUBLISHED ARTEFACTS and must stay tracked.

# Node tooling. The two document builders need Playwright to render PDFs;
# nothing npm unpacks belongs in the repo, least of all a browser binary.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/

# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is what pins the toolchain
# to the same version on the desktop and the laptop.

# Playwright's own scratch output, if a future test run produces any.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/

# Editor and OS litter.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
